{ The Wing Gambit is an interesting and sound sacrifice against the French Defense. }
1. e4 e6 2. Nf3 d5 3. e5 { And what should we do here? } 3... c5 4. b4 { This is the Wing Gambit. Accept the sacrifice. } 4... cxb4 5. a3 { Yum! More pawns to eat! } 5... bxa3 6. d4 { We can't attack white's center as easily, but we are up material! This is a tricky line, so be careful, but if you are, you should be fine. } *

